---
// /researchhub/publications/ — per the section spec this is an ALIAS of the
// About "PublicationsAll" listing (NOT a hub query): the legacy mounted the same
// PublicationsAll.vue here and at /about/publications. The publications LISTING
// component is owned by the About/Publications section and is not yet ported to
// Astro, so — matching the legacy /publications redirect, which sends users to
// /about/publications/ — this route 301-redirects to the canonical listing.
//
// FLAG: when the About owner builds the shared PublicationsListing component,
// replace this redirect with an SSR render of getAllPublications() + that
// component (the data fetcher getAllPublications already exists in lib/data.ts).
return Astro.redirect('/about/publications/', 301);
---
